;===============================
;戦闘行動に応じて素質ごとの忠誠度上昇量を算出
;ARG      対象キャラクタ
;ARG:1    입력행동
;RESULT   忠誠度上昇量
;===============================
;[좀비]はＨＰ・ＭＰ・ＭＡＧの残量に応じて忠誠度が上昇
@COMBAT_HIGH_ゾンビ(ARG,ARG:1)
LOCAL = BASE:ARG:ＨＰ == 0    ? 0     # BASE:ARG:ＨＰ * 100 / MAXBASE:ARG:ＨＰ
LOCAL = MAXBASE:ARG:ＭＰ == 0 ? LOCAL # MIN(LOCAL,BASE:ARG:ＭＰ * 100 / MAXBASE:ARG:ＭＰ)
LOCAL = MAXBASE:ARG:CP == 0   ? LOCAL # MIN(LOCAL,GET_CHARA_STOCK_MAG(ARG) * 100 / GET_CHARA_MAXMAG(ARG))
RETURN SQRT(LOCAL)-4